Task make_8_lvl3:
Propose a retrosynthesis route to synthesize the molecule with SMILES O=S(NC1=CC(N2CCN(C(OC(C)(C)C)=O)CC2)=C3C(CCC4(CCC4)O3)=C1)(C5=C(F)C=CC=C5)=O. The leaves on the retrosynthesis tree should be commercially available chemicals. The price of all the chemicals cannot exceed $9999.0. The final route should not surpass 6 steps.

Required submission format:
Submit a JSON object representing the retrosynthesis route. It must follow the same JSON format as the next example: `{
  "type": "mol",
  "smiles": "CO",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "reaction",
      "template_id": 1234,
